stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> LOGGING_ACTIVE : CAN_ID_START_ENABLED=n (default)
    [*] --> LOGGING_IDLE   : CAN_ID_START_ENABLED=y

    LOGGING_IDLE   --> LOGGING_ACTIVE : RX == CAN_ID_START\n[CAN_ID_START_ENABLED]
    LOGGING_ACTIVE --> LOGGING_IDLE   : RX == CAN_ID_STOP\n[CAN_ID_STOP_ENABLED]

    LOGGING_ACTIVE --> LOGGING_ACTIVE : any other frame / logger_print_frame()

    note right of LOGGING_ACTIVE
        CAN_ID_HELLO [CAN_ID_HELLO_ENABLED] triggers
        printk("hello world") in both states.
        The frame is not logged.
    end note
